    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin logs various activities in WordPress:<br />\n* User logins and logouts<br />\n* Post and page creation, updates, trashing, and permanent deletion<br />\n* Plugin activation, deactivation, and deletion<br />\n* Filter logs: Login / Logout, Plugins, Publications, Users,</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>activitylog</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>A new &#8220;Activity Log&#8221; menu will appear in the admin area. View logs there.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='where%20is%20the%20log%20file%20stored%3F'>\nWhere is the log file stored?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The log file (<code>activitylog.txt</code>) is stored in the plugin directory.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20change%20how%20long%20logs%20are%20kept%3F'>\nHow do I change how long logs are kept?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Use the &#8220;Retention (days)&#8221; setting on the Activity Log Settings page.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0 &#8211; January 24, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1 &#8211; February 19, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>add Filter</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
